      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A vacuum or inert-atmosphere anneal at 950–1050 °C for 2–3 hours followed by rapid quenching is an effective intervention for this W–Cu composite.",
